OL,3,GNEWSATeaching assistant jailed for
OL,4,Aabusing girl in care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teaching assistant has been sentenced
OL,7,Fto 16 months in prison after pleading
OL,8,Fguilty to sexual activity with a
OL,9,Fteenage girl he was supposed to be
OL,10,Fsupporting in a West Yorkshire care
OL,11,Fhome.
OL,13,FAasim Qureshi, 37, from Bradford,
OL,14,Fadmitted three counts of sexual
OL,15,Factivity with a child aged 15 or 16. He
OL,16,Fwas also barred from working with
OL,17,Fchildren or vulnerable adults for 10
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,20,FPolice said the offences took place in
OL,21,F2021 while he was working with the girl
OL,22,Fat the home in the Bradford area.
